        "Compute population variance"
      ],
      "starter_code": "def variance(xs):\n    # TODO\n    pass\n",
      "solution_code": "def variance(xs):\n    m = sum(xs) / len(xs)\n    return sum((x - m) ** 2 for x in xs) / len(xs)\n",
